<li class=3D"g-md-li">names that element <code class=3D"g-md-code">temp</co=
de></li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">stores the value of <code class=3D"g-md-code">temp + =
20</code> in a new list called <code class=3D"g-md-code">temperatures_adjus=
