index</span><span class=3D"mtk1"> </span><span class=3D"mtk12">for</span><s=
pan class=3D"mtk1"> </span><span class=3D"mtk9">index</span><span class=3D"=
mtk1"> </span><span class=3D"mtk12">in</span><span class=3D"mtk1"> range(</=
span><span class=3D"mtk9">5</span><span class=3D"mtk1">)]</span></span><br>=
<span><span class=3D"mtk16"># [0.0, 2.0, 4.0, 6.0, 8.0] </span></span><br><=
