e(</span><span class=3D"mtk9">5</span><span class=3D"mtk1">)]</span></span>=
<br><span><span class=3D"mtk16"># [0.8, 2.8, 4.8, 6.8, 8.8]</span></span><b=
r><span><span></span></span><br></div></code></pre></pre>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">To calculate <code class=3D"g-md-code">x_values_2</code=
>, we went through the list <code class=3D"g-md-code">range(5)</code>, whic=
